section
open MvPolynomial NumberField IsDedekindDomain Formalism.BasicNotions Formalism.L2.DIV Formalism.L2.Col GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.InterlacingEquivariance GlobalTheory.BranchFormula

